        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86702, Modern Hunter Knob</b>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>This item is on long-term backorder from the manufacturer. Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for availability.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hunter Cabinet Knob is available in 1-1/4 inch or 1-5/8 inch sizes. This modern square cabinet knob comes in your choice of contemporary finish colors. Emtek's Modern Hunter Knob can be used all over the house on small doors and drawers. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Hunter Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86702-specifications.pdf?v=1704262415\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Hunter Cabinet Knob Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86702: Small</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86703: Large</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
